# Ternoa Bridge Relayer Architecture Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains a historical public architecture audit report completed by Softstack for Ternoa.

Ternoa is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a bridge relayer and blockchain infrastructure security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Ternoa  
Audit type: Bridge relayer architecture audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[02_Architecture_Audit_Ternoa_Bridge_Relayer.pdf](./02_Architecture_Audit_Ternoa_Bridge_Relayer.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed architecture security review work for bridge relayer infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s security work connected to bridge relayer architecture, blockchain infrastructure and cross chain system review.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
